<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Earn Raftaar Agency Support</title>

<style>
*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
}

html,body{
width:100%;
height:100%;
overflow:hidden;
background:#000;
}

body{
background:url('background.png') center center/cover no-repeat;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
}

.container{
width:100%;
max-width:430px;
height:100vh;
padding:10px;
display:flex;
flex-direction:column;
justify-content:space-between;
}

.logo{
text-align:center;
}

.logo img{
max-width:100%;
height:auto;
}

.title{
text-align:center;
color:#fff;
}

.title h1{
font-size:40px;
line-height:1;
font-weight:900;
}

.title h2{
font-size:38px;
color:#b84cff;
font-weight:900;
}

.title p{
margin-top:8px;
font-size:16px;
}

.whatsapp-btn{
display:block;
width:100%;
text-align:center;
}

.whatsapp-btn img{
width:100%;
max-height:80px;
object-fit:contain;
}

.features{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);
gap:5px;
}

.features img{
width:100%;
border-radius:10px;
}

.security{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
gap:8px;
}

.security img{
width:100%;
}

.rating{
display:flex;
align-items:center;
justify-content:center;
gap:10px;
}

.rating img{
width:180px;
}

.rating-text{
color:#fff;
font-size:24px;
font-weight:bold;
}

.bottom{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
gap:5px;
}

.bottom img{
width:100%;
}

@media(max-height:850px){

.title h1{
font-size:34px;
}

.title h2{
font-size:32px;
}

.rating-text{
font-size:20px;
}

}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

<div class="logo">
<img src="logo.png" alt="">
</div>

<div class="title">
<p>NEW HOSTING ID CREATE SUPPORT</p>
<h1>HOST ID & AGENCY</h1>
<h2>SETUP PROBLEM?</h2>
<p>CONTACT US FROM WHATSAPP</p>
</div>

<a class="whatsapp-btn"
href="https://wa.me/919353670331"
target="_blank">

<img src="whatsapp-button.png" alt="">
</a>

<div class="features">
<img src="card1.png">
<img src="card2.png">
<img src="card3.png">
<img src="card4.png">
<img src="card5.png">
</div>

<div class="security">
<img src="secure1.png">
<img src="secure2.png">
<img src="secure3.png">
</div>

<div class="rating">
<img src="rating-users.png">
<div class="rating-text">
⭐ 4.9/5
</div>
</div>

<div class="bottom">
<img src="support1.png">
<img src="support2.png">
<img src="support3.png">
<img src="support4.png">
</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
